  | 0xFD 96:Bu32 => VUNOP (I8 X 16) ABS
  | 0xFD 97:Bu32 => VUNOP (I8 X 16) NEG
  | 0xFD 98:Bu32 => VUNOP (I8 X 16) POPCNT
